  "summary": "Hi, I'm Duke, a Software Engineer at Torrential Data Solutions and recent University of Virginia alum, based out of Northern Virginia/Washington DC. I've worked across the full stack, from backend systems to frontend feature development. During my time at Torrential Data, I've worked on a C#-to-Rust backend migration and built a self-service workflow configuration system spanning our frontend and backend from the ground up. Outside of work, I am an avid volleyball player, follow the Wizards and Commanders, and spend my free time exploring national parks or playing chess. \n\nAlways happy to connect, reach me here or at nguyendukee@gmail.com.",
